---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = 'April 2026';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How CorobotX collects, uses, and protects visitor information.">
  <section class="border-b border-surface-variant">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 pt-24 md:pt-32 pb-12">
      <div class="label-caps text-brand-orange mb-4">// LEGAL</div>
      <h1 class="font-sans font-black text-[40px] md:text-[64px] text-on-surface uppercase leading-tight tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mono-data text-outline mt-4">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-surface-container-lowest">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-16 flex flex-col gap-10 font-sans text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="label-caps text-brand-orange mb-3">01 · Scope</h2>
        <p>
          This policy describes how CorobotX ("we", "us") handles information collected through our
          marketing website and contact forms. It does not cover data processed under separate
          engineering contracts with clients.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="label-caps text-brand-orange mb-3">02 · Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect only the information you voluntarily submit through our contact form — typically
        your name, email address, organization, and a description of your project. We do not use
        tracking cookies beyond basic traffic analytics.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="label-caps text-brand-orange mb-3">03 · How We Use It</h2>
        <p>
          Submitted information is used solely to respond to your inquiry and to prepare a technical
          proposal. We do not sell contact data and do not share it with third parties outside the
          engagement lifecycle.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="label-caps text-brand-orange mb-3">04 · Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          You may request deletion or modification of any data you have submitted by emailing
          <a href="mailto:info@corobotx.com" class="text-brand-orange underline">info@corobotx.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="label-caps text-brand-orange mb-3">05 · Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions? Reach us at
          <a href="mailto:info@corobotx.com" class="text-brand-orange underline">info@corobotx.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
